(Col}(A))=5=\\text{rank}(A) \\\\  & \\text{Null}(A)=\\{0\\} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Null}(A))=0=\\text{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each statement in turn. \n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed,   a matrix $A$ is invertible if and only if $det(A)\\ne 0.$ Since here we have $det(A)=1\\ne 0,$ our matrix $A$ must be  invertible.\n\n- Statement II is false. Indeed, by the invertible matrix theorem\n$A$ is invertible $\\,⇔\\,\\text{rank}(A)=5.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since $\\text{rank}(A)=5$,  it must be $\\text{dim(Col}(A))=5$ which, in turn, means that  $A$ has $5$ pivot columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435677 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435678 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435677 1062 #uuid "42d8e8b3-7048-5f94-884b-ae373fb59042" 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435677 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435676 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435678 1062 #uuid "9a467517-2fb7-54c3-b455-e47e7392ef56" 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435678 1063 #edb/ref 17592186272239 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435679 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435677 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435679 1062 #uuid "d2193342-5bc1-5a6f-99d1-42bf1fad6047" 13194139534775 17592186045417 true] [17592186435679 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124863 13194139534775 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-26e5acff-8db9-5e5d-9122-36baf139baac" 17592186435669 "answer-293235d4-a2f2-5777-a667-1540f003765f" 17592186435670 "answer-46090913-fe8a-53d8-a2e2-1edec9407dcb" 17592186435671 "answer-596e4b3c-1fd0-573a-82a9-d1617135d478" 17592186435672 "answer-75acd049-7010-5a98-8813-f29e53e8c979" 17592186435673 "answer-7c2003c1-be5a-5ec0-8d3f-914e8ee86a4a" 17592186435674 "answer-field-7e9f16a7-f4b2-5dc6-b4b7-1d7e51e453fc" 17592186435675 "question-ea4581af-a083-51da-803f-0f83b3ed2ea6" 17592186435676 "step-42d8e8b3-7048-5f94-884b-ae373fb59042" 17592186435677 "step-9a467517